==Strategy==
[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] can help immensely in this stage. If you have him, use him, and make sure he is at least level 12. Pair it with an attacker like [[Food Stall Cat (Rare Cat)|Delivery Cat]] or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] to quickly take care of the Gabriels. Otherwise, use cats like [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]]. Use a [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitter]] like [[Moneko (Special Cat)|Moneko]], [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat]] or [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Cat]] to take care of the Metal Hippoes. Alternatively, you can use a cat with a fast attack rate like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] or [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dom Cat]].

